OL,3,ARapist serving life may face more
OL,4,Aassault charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA convicted serial rapist described by
OL,7,Fpolice as "one of the most prolific
OL,8,Fpredators" in the UK could face further
OL,9,Fcharges after fresh allegations
OL,10,Finvolving seven more women were passed
OL,11,Fto prosecutors.
OL,13,FChinese national Zhenhao Zou is serving
OL,14,Fa life sentence with a minimum term of
OL,15,F24 years after he was found guilty of
OL,16,Fdrugging and raping 10 women in London
OL,17,Fand China between September 2019 and
OL,18,FMay 2023.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
